==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gary Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage; Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] help with clearing out the swarms of units. Otherwise, good meatshielding while stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] is enough to win this.

